{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-awesome-all-timeline-js","path":"/2022/3/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Track Awesome List"}},"allAwesomeItem":{"nodes":[{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>Analytics, Events and Statistics</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://posthog.com\">PostHog</a> - Full Product Analytics suite free for up to 1m tracked events per month</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T12:06:43.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>PaaS</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.serverless.com/cloud\">Serverless Cloud</a> - Serverless Cloud lets you build Serverless APIs, DBs and Storage by using infrastrucure <em>from</em> code approach(no yaml, no infrastructure configuration). The product is provided by Serverless Inc. and currently under public preview.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T11:51:28.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>Testing</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://thundra.io/foresight\">Foresight</a> — Thundra Foresight is a tool for debugging and troubleshooting test failures in no time and optimizing build duration and performance in your CI pipeline.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T08:56:39.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>APIs, Data and ML</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://bruzu.com/\">Bruzu</a> — Automate Image production. Generate tons of Image variants with API, Integrations or nocode sheet. API is FREE with watermark.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T07:55:14.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>Messaging and Streaming</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://developers.eyeson.team/\">eyeson API</a> - A video communication API service based on WebRTC (SFU, MCU) to build video platforms. Allows RealTime Data Injection, Video Layouts, Recordings, a fully featured hosted web UI (quickstart) or packages for custom UIs. Has a <a href=\"https://apiservice.eyeson.com/api-pricing\">free tier for developers</a> with 1000 meeting minutes a month.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T07:43:02.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>PaaS</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://okteto.com\">Okteto Cloud</a> - Managed Kubernetes service designed for remote development. Free developer accounts come with 5 Kubernetes namespaces, 3Gi/pod with a maximum of 8Gi/namespace, 1CPU/pod with a maximum of 4CPUs/namespace and 5GB Disk space. The apps sleep after 24 hours of inactivity.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T06:57:46.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>BaaS</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://nhost.io\">nhost.io</a> - Serverless backend for web and mobile apps. Free plan includes: PostgreSQL, GraphQL (Hasura), Authentication, Storage, and Serverless Functions.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T06:43:40.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"mcauser/awesome-micropython","categoryHTML":"<h2>Libraries</h2><h4>Ethernet</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/przemobe/micropy-ENC28J60\">micropy-ENC28J60</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/przemobe/micropy-ENC28J60\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">3</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":3,\"repo\":\"przemobe/micropy-ENC28J60\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - ENC28J60 Ethernet chip driver for MicroPython (RP2).</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T06:41:41.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"mcauser/awesome-micropython","categoryHTML":"<h2>Frameworks</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://codeberg.org/scy/perthensis\">perthensis</a> - Perthensis: an asynchronous framework for MicroPython.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T06:41:35.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"mcauser/awesome-micropython","categoryHTML":"<h2>Libraries</h2><h4>Bluetooth</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://codeberg.org/scy/mijia-temphum-upy\">mijia-temphum-upy</a> - MicroPython library to read certain Xiaomi Mijia BLE temperature &#x26; humidity sensors.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T06:41:28.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"mcauser/awesome-micropython","categoryHTML":"<h2>Libraries</h2><h4>Bluetooth</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://codeberg.org/scy/micropython-xiaomi-ble-adv-parse\">micropython-xiaomi-ble-adv-parse</a> - Passively retrieve sensor data from some Xiaomi Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) sensors.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T06:41:18.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Deep Learning</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://paperswithcode.com/\">paperswithcode.com</a> — \"The mission of Papers with Code is to create a free and open resource with Machine Learning papers, code, datasets, methods and evaluation tables.\"</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T05:03:03.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Deep Learning</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/labmlai/annotated_deep_learning_paper_implementations\"><code>labmlai/annotated_deep_learning_paper_implementations</code></a> — \"Implementations/tutorials of deep learning papers with side-by-side notes.\" 50+ of them! Really nicely annotated and explained.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-17T05:03:03.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","categoryHTML":"<h2>Other Free Resources</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://get.localhost.direct\">get.localhost.direct</a> — A better *.localhost.direct Wildcard public CA signed SSL cert for localhost development 